@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Inputs Pp (Primary charge), Pz (independent Zendure charge),\nE (Grid export), Pmax;
:Harvest SMA_NEAR_LIMIT eligibility;
if (Pz physical reference valid?) then (ja)
  :raw B = Pz + E;\nABSOLUTE_EXPORT_CAPTURE;
else (nein)
  :raw B = last_input + effective_export * gain;\nINCREMENTAL_FALLBACK;
endif
:Clamp -> Smoothing -> Ramp -> Baseline B;
:Fast NEAR_LIMIT separately checks\nPp >= Pmax-150W and E>=100W;
:R = max(0, Pmax-Pp);\ndesired O=max(0,E-R);\nHeadroom limit;
:A400/R100;\nshadow=B, active=B+O;
:Cross-Charge last; if active O=0 and re-evaluate B;
stop
note right
If HIGH_SMA_SOC also applies:
share = current Harvest time profile
T=Pp+Pz+E
PrimaryShare=min(Pmax,max(Floor,share*T))
ZendureShare=max(0,T-PrimaryShare)
Capture=Pz+E
raw B=max(ZendureShare,Capture)
harvest_target_selected_by =
STRATEGIC_SHARE / EXPORT_CAPTURE / BOTH_EQUAL
end note
@enduml
